  "goodToKnow": "Die Raffinerie is a refinery: eine Erdölraffinerie, eine Zuckerraffinerie. Raffinieren means to refine. The PCK refinery in Schwedt, which supplies much of Berlin's fuel, became a political issue after 2022 because it had processed Russian oil via the Druzhba pipeline. Raffiniert also means cunning or clever: ein raffinierter Plan. Plural: die Raffinerien."
